# Terraform
# State holds secrets in plaintext and must never be committed. The lock file
# is committed on purpose, so everyone resolves the same provider versions.
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Real values, including the SES sender and alert email. Examples are committed.
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example
!*.tfvars.example
